  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "@hui-xu-ai/dsh-wensu",
      "title": {
        "en": "Wensu · CNKI and Web of Science search",
        "zh": "文溯 · 知网与 Web of Science 检索"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Before answering a scientific or technical question, the AI searches CNKI and Web of Science and reads the paper itself — answers come with citations back to the text, not made up. Search: it queries those two databases directly (not the open web), pulls a whole batch at once and screens by abstract and impact factor. Read: it opens the paper in the browser you are signed in to, reads the full text, and returns per-section highlights, key sentences and key numbers with the exact sentence they came from. Read-only, no PDF downloads, and it stops at a captcha for you. Needs Windows, Python 3.11+, wensu on PATH, plus the browser extension and native host.",
        "zh": "回答科学专业问题前，AI 会先查知网和 Web of Science、读完论文正文再作答，答案带原文出处，不瞎编。查库：直接查这两个库（不是搜公开网页），一次取回上百篇，先按摘要和影响因子筛出要读的。读正文：在你已登录的浏览器里打开论文、整篇读完，给出每节要点、关键句和带原句的关键数据。只读、不下载 PDF，遇到验证码停下等你处理。需要 Windows、Python 3.11+、PATH 中的 wensu，以及浏览器扩展和原生宿主。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/wensu.svg",
      "author": "hui-xu-ai",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/hui-xu-ai/wensu",
      "repository": {
        "url": "https://github.com/hui-xu-ai/wensu",
        "directory": "packages/dsh-wensu"
      },
